  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIBE 2024 - Comet Trawl ApS - Providing Sustainable and Fish Habitat Protective Efficient Midwater Trawling Fishing Gear, Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aim is to actively supply effective fishing gear based on Danish design. The business objective is to establish a trawl and net producing netloft based on the company&#x2019;s own expertise and knowledge, as well as to supply fish finding technologies and modern Danish fish selection tools.</narrative>
  </description>
